    "1. **Document Management**: Store consulting engagements with rich metadata\n",
    "2. **Semantic Search**: Find similar cases using embeddings or keyword matching\n",
    "3. **Intelligent Recommendations**: Suggest approaches, timelines, and resource allocation\n",
    "4. **AI-Powered Synthesis**: Generate strategic insights using LLMs or metadata analysis\n",
    "5. **Industry Analysis**: Identify trends and patterns in specific industries\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Features:**\n",
    "- ✅ Works WITHOUT API keys (graceful degradation)\n",
    "- ✅ Semantic search with embeddings\n",
    "- ✅ LLM-powered insights (Anthropic Claude & OpenAI GPT-4)\n",
    "- ✅ Comprehensive CLI interface\n",
    "- ✅ Production-ready code (SOLID principles, type hints, error handling)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Next Steps:**\n",
